{"tmdb":1689005,"tagline":"Step up and be a boss.","synopsis":"When her mother suddenly dies, Sonja is thrown into tumult. Dealing with early-twenties existential angst and a sense of responsibility for her teenage younger sister Emma, she has a lot on her plate. Suddenly under the care of her controlling grandma and—as a young woman living with Down syndrome—constantly faced with a society that judges what she’s capable of, Sonja is desperate to be herself and take charge of her own life. When a chance encounter with the charismatic Hakim leads her to a krump class, Sonja discovers a life-changing outlet for expression.","directors":[{"name":"Genevieve Clay-Smith","id":1725118}],"cast":[{"actor":"Olivia Hargroder","role":"Sonja","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qZwrQLlQKNeJRx6c5p4RnOoTU2r.jpg","tmdb":5820343},{"actor":"Penny Downie","role":"Doris","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8zpun3JUlElJ8VEHZlnzq5Kxxuh.jpg","tmdb":108579},{"actor":"Julia Savage","role":"Emma","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6wqvki5qZEsO59rGerhN12G0VHB.jpg","tmdb":1966493},{"actor":"Beth Champion","role":"Marion","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1ajE8qNWfsMfmldurgyurNZ4W3j.jpg","tmdb":942259},{"actor":"Elijah Williams","role":"Hakim","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xeVl9WMWCOBraogQXAnEh7fxfEG.jpg","tmdb":2382845},{"actor":"Shayan Murray","role":"Rohan","photo":null,"tmdb":3704036},{"actor":"Chris Bunton","role":"Micheal","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7PUMlbdrtCtrsAbO8WUmGWQtXsG.jpg","tmdb":1973027},{"actor":"Jessica Trueman","role":"Lily","photo":null,"tmdb":6198435}],"trailers":[{"key":"lft4KUoTz7E","name":"Boss Cat Official Trailer","type":"Trailer","published":"2026-05-29"}],"official":"https://busstopfilms.com.au/production/boss-cat","watch":{},"artwork":{"posters":[["/bGVQFQbDdaGp6lWUvc3WV8AmBEH.jpg",1924,2835],["/fYYPV721h53MycLYSVm0aAqFScp.jpg",600,857],["/51VNYuPSNZM0RpW8e2O72A0b376.jpg",663,994]],"backdrops":[["/sQG4DybAjQidK4Ddp1fJ0